  "notes": [
    "O/S/D use paper convention: higher = safer (0-10).",
    "Risk score Pi = cbrt(O*S*D).",
    "Metric to O/S/D mapping is UNRESOLVED research — not encoded here.",
    "FRIES2 formulas are PROPOSED and intentionally absent."
